// @description Generated invoice of a bot payment
// @param description Product description, 1-255 characters
// @param extended_media Deprecated
// @param flags Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param invoice The actual invoice
// @param payload Bot-defined invoice payload, 1-128 bytes. This will not be displayed to the user, use for your internal processes.
// @param photo URL of the product photo for the invoice. Can be a photo of the goods or a marketing image for a service. People like it better when they see what they are paying for.
// @param provider Payments provider token, obtained via Botfather
// @param provider_data JSON-encoded data about the invoice, which will be shared with the payment provider. A detailed description of required fields should be provided by the payment provider.
// @param start_param Unique bot deep links start parameter . If present, forwarded copies of the sent message will have a URL button with a deep link to the bot (instead of a Pay button), with the value used as the start parameter. If absent, forwarded copies of the sent message will have a Pay button, allowing multiple users to pay directly from the forwarded message, using the same invoice.
// @param title Product name, 1-32 characters
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/links#bot-links
// @see https://core.telegram.org/bots/payments
// @see https://core.telegram.org/mtproto/TL-combinators#conditional-fields
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/%23
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/DataJSON
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/InputMedia
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/InputWebDocument
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/Invoice
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/bytes
// @see https://core.telegram.org/type/string
// @see https://t.me/botfather
inputMediaInvoice#405fef0d flags:# title:string description:string photo:flags.0?InputWebDocument invoice:Invoice payload:bytes provider:flags.3?string provider_data:DataJSON start_param:flags.1?string extended_media:flags.2?InputMedia = InputMedia;
