// @description Extended user info
// @param about Bio of the user
// @param birthday Contains info about the user's birthday » .
// @param blocked Whether you have blocked this user
// @param blocked_my_stories_from Whether we've blocked this user, preventing them from seeing our stories » .
// @param bot_broadcast_admin_rights A suggested set of administrator rights for the bot, to be shown when adding the bot as admin to a channel, see here for more info on how to handle them » .
// @param bot_can_manage_emoji_status If set, this is a bot that can change our emoji status »
// @param bot_group_admin_rights A suggested set of administrator rights for the bot, to be shown when adding the bot as admin to a group, see here for more info on how to handle them » .
// @param bot_info For bots, info about the bot (bot commands, etc)
// @param bot_manager_id If this user is a managed bot » , the ID of the user or manager bot that manages it.
// @param bot_verification Describes a bot verification icon » .
// @param business_away_message Telegram Business away message » .
// @param business_greeting_message Telegram Business greeting message » .
// @param business_intro Specifies a custom Telegram Business profile introduction » .
// @param business_location Telegram Business location » .
// @param business_work_hours Telegram Business working hours » .
// @param can_pin_message Whether you can pin messages in the chat with this user, you can do this only for a chat with yourself
// @param can_view_revenue If set, this user can view ad revenue statistics » for this bot.
// @param common_chats_count Chats in common with this user
// @param contact_require_premium If set, we cannot write to this user: subscribe to Telegram Premium to get permission to write to this user. To set this flag for ourselves invoke account.setGlobalPrivacySettings , setting the settings.new_noncontact_peers_require_premium flag, see here » for more info.
// @param disallowed_gifts Disallows the reception of specific gift types.
// @param display_gifts_button If this flag is set for both us and another user (changed through globalPrivacySettings ), a gift button should always be displayed in the text field in private chats with the other user: once clicked, the gift UI should be displayed, offering the user options to gift Telegram Premium » subscriptions or Telegram Gifts » .
// @param fallback_photo Fallback profile photo, displayed if no photo is present in profile_photo or personal_photo , due to privacy settings.
// @param flags Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param flags2 Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param folder_id Peer folder ID, for more info click here
// @param has_scheduled Whether scheduled messages are available
// @param id User ID
// @param main_tab The main tab for the user's profile, see here » for more info.
// @param noforwards_my_enabled If set, content protection » was enabled in this private chat by us.
// @param noforwards_peer_enabled If set, content protection » was enabled in this private chat by this user.
// @param note A private note for this contact, only visible to us; see here » for more info on contact notes.
// @param notify_settings Notification settings
// @param personal_channel_id ID of the associated personal channel » , that should be shown in the profile page .
// @param personal_channel_message ID of the latest message of the associated personal channel » , that should be previewed in the profile page .
// @param personal_photo Personal profile photo, to be shown instead of profile_photo .
// @param phone_calls_available Whether this user can make VoIP calls
// @param phone_calls_private Whether this user's privacy settings allow you to call them
// @param pinned_msg_id Message ID of the last pinned message
// @param private_forward_name Anonymized text to be shown instead of the user's name on forwarded messages
// @param profile_photo Profile photo
// @param read_dates_private If set, we cannot fetch the exact read date of messages we send to this user using messages.getOutboxReadDate . The exact read date of messages might still be unavailable for other reasons, see here » for more info. To set this flag for ourselves invoke account.setGlobalPrivacySettings , setting the settings.hide_read_marks flag.
// @param saved_music The first song on the music tab of the profile, see here » for more info on the music profile tab.
// @param send_paid_messages_stars If set and bigger than 0, this user has enabled paid messages » and we must pay the specified amount of Stars to send messages to them, see here » for the full flow. If set and equal to 0, the user requires payment in general but we were exempted from paying for any of the reasons specified in the docs » .
// @param settings Peer settings
// @param sponsored_enabled Whether ads were re-enabled for the current account (only accessible to the currently logged-in user), see here » for more info.
// @param stargifts_count Number of gifts the user has chosen to display on their profile
// @param starref_program This bot has an active referral program »
// @param stars_my_pending_rating Our pending star rating , only visible for ourselves.
