// @param translations_disabled Whether the real-time chat translation popup should be hidden.
// @param ttl_period Time To Live of all messages in this chat; once a message is this many seconds old, it must be deleted.
// @param unofficial_security_risk If set, this user uses an unofficial Telegram client, and messages sent to them may be less secure; clients should display a warning in the user's profile.
// @param video_calls_available Whether the user can receive video calls
// @param voice_messages_forbidden Whether this user doesn't allow sending voice messages in a private chat with them
// @param wallpaper Wallpaper to use in the private chat with the user.
