// @param length Length of message entity within message (in UTF-16 code units )
// @param long_date Renders the time in long format: always month, date and year, all according the user's locale settings; cannot be combined with short_date .
// @param long_time Renders the time in long format: hours, minutes, seconds and maybe timezone, according to the user's locale settings; cannot be combined with short_time .
// @param offset Offset of message entity within message (in UTF-16 code units )
// @param relative If set, render a relative date, see here » for more info. Cannot be combined with any of the other flags.
// @param short_date Renders the time in short format: month, date, (and year, if different from the current one), all according the user's locale settings; cannot be combined with long_date .
