// @description Poll
// @param answers The possible answers (2- poll_answers_max ), vote using messages.sendVote .
// @param close_date Point in time (Unix timestamp) when the poll will be automatically closed. Up to poll_close_period_max » seconds in the future; can't be used together with close_period.
// @param close_period Amount of time in seconds the poll will be active after creation, up to poll_close_period_max » seconds. Can't be used together with close_date.
// @param closed Whether the poll is closed and doesn't accept any more answers
// @param countries_iso2 If set, only users from the specified ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country codes may vote, see country-restricted polls » ; a user may vote only if the phone_country_iso2 » configuration parameter is contained in this list.
// @param creator Whether the current user created this poll
// @param flags Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param hash Hash for use with messages.getPollResults
// @param hide_results_until_close Whether vote results are hidden from all participants until the poll is closed
// @param id ID of the poll
// @param multiple_choice Whether multiple options can be chosen as answer
// @param open_answers Whether users can add new answer options after the poll is created, see open-answer polls »
// @param public_voters Whether cast votes are publicly visible to all users (non-anonymous poll)
// @param question The question of the poll (only Premium users can use custom emoji entities here).
// @param quiz Whether this is a quiz (with wrong and correct answers, results shown in the return type). When creating a poll, the correct answers are specified in inputMediaPoll . correct_answers .
// @param revoting_disabled If set, users cannot change their vote after casting it
// @param shuffle_answers Whether answer options are displayed in a randomized order to each user
// @param subscribers_only Whether only subscribers can vote: a user may vote only if they are currently a member of the channel/supergroup and joined it at least 24 hours before the poll was posted, see subscriber-only polls » .
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/config#phone-country-iso2
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/config#poll-answers-max
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/config#poll-close-period-max
