// @description Represents the rights of an admin in a channel/supergroup .
// @param add_admins If set, allows the admin to add other admins with the same (or more limited) permissions in the channel/supergroup
// @param anonymous Whether this admin is anonymous
// @param ban_users If set, allows the admin to ban users from the channel/supergroup
// @param change_info If set, allows the admin to modify the description of the channel/supergroup
// @param delete_messages If set, allows the admin to also delete messages from other admins in the channel
// @param delete_stories If set, allows the admin to delete stories posted by the other admins of the channel .
// @param edit_messages If set, allows the admin to also edit messages from other admins in the channel
// @param edit_stories If set, allows the admin to edit stories posted by the other admins of the channel .
