// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/paid-messages
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/premium#gifting-telegram-premium
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/privacy#require-premium-for-new-non-contact-users
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/stars
