// @description Represents a Telegram Stars or TON transaction » .
// @param ads_proceeds_from_date Indicates that this is payment for ad revenue from the specified unixtime (always set together with ads_proceeds_to_date ).
// @param ads_proceeds_to_date Indicates that this is payment for ad revenue to the specified unixtime.
// @param amount Amount of Telegram Stars or TON.
// @param bot_payload Bot specified invoice payload (i.e. the payload passed to inputMediaInvoice when creating the invoice ).
// @param business_transfer This transaction transfers stars from the balance of a user account connected to a business bot , to the balance of the business bot, see here » for more info.
// @param date Date of the transaction (unixtime).
// @param description For transactions with bots, description of the bought product.
// @param extended_media The purchased paid media » .
// @param failed This transaction has failed.
// @param flags Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param floodskip_number This transaction is payment for paid bot broadcasts . Paid broadcasts are only allowed if the allow_paid_floodskip parameter of messages.sendMessage and other message sending methods is set while trying to broadcast more than 30 messages per second to bot users. The integer value returned by this flag indicates the number of billed API calls.
// @param gift This transaction was a gift from the user in peer.peer .
// @param giveaway_post_id ID of the message containing the messageMediaGiveaway , for incoming star giveaway prizes .
// @param id Transaction ID.
// @param msg_id For paid media transactions » , message ID of the paid media posted to peer.peer (can point to a deleted message; either way, extended_media will always contain the bought media).
// @param offer Represents payment for a collectible gift purchase offer » .
// @param paid_messages This transaction is related to the reception or transmission of a paid message » .
// @param peer Source of the incoming transaction, or its recipient for outgoing transactions.
// @param pending The transaction is currently pending.
// @param phonegroup_message Represents payment for a paid text message sent during a group call or live video stream » .
// @param photo For transactions with bots, photo of the bought product.
// @param posts_search Represents payment for a paid global post search » .
// @param premium_gift_months This transaction indicates the payment for a gifted Telegram Premium subscription » .
// @param reaction This transaction is a paid reaction » .
// @param refund Whether this transaction is a refund.
// @param stargift This transaction indicates a purchase or a sale (conversion back to Stars) of a gift » .
// @param stargift_auction_bid Represents payment for placing a collectible gift auction bid » .
// @param stargift_drop_original_details Represents payment for the removal of the starGiftAttributeOriginalDetails attribute from a gift, see here » for the full flow.
// @param stargift_prepaid_upgrade Represents payment for a separate prepaid upgrade of a gift .
// @param stargift_resale This transaction is related to the resale of a collectible gift » .
// @param stargift_upgrade This transaction pays for the upgrade of a gift to a collectible gift » .
// @param starref_amount For transactions made by referred users , the amount of Telegram Stars received by the affiliate, can be negative for refunds.
// @param starref_commission_permille This transaction is the receival (or refund) of an affiliate commission (i.e. this is the transaction received by the peer that created the referral link , flag 17 is for transactions made by users that imported the referral link).
// @param starref_peer For transactions made by referred users , the peer that received the affiliate commission.
// @param subscription_period The number of seconds between consecutive Telegram Star debiting for Telegram Star subscriptions » .
// @param title For transactions with bots, title of the bought product.
// @param transaction_date If neither pending nor failed are set, the transaction was completed successfully, and this field will contain the point in time (Unix timestamp) when the withdrawal was completed successfully.
// @param transaction_url If neither pending nor failed are set, the transaction was completed successfully, and this field will contain a URL where the withdrawal transaction can be viewed.
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/auctions
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/bots/connected-business-bots
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/bots/referrals
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts#collectible-gift-purchase-offers
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts#collectible-gifts
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts#dropping-the-original-details-of-an-upgraded-gift
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts#prepaying-for-someone-elses-upgrade
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/gifts#reselling-collectible-gifts
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/giveaways#star-giveaways
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/group-calls
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/links#referral-links
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/paid-media
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/paid-messages
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/payments
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/premium#gifting-telegram-premium
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/reactions#paid-reactions
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/search#posts-tab
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/stars
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/stars#star-subscriptions
// @see https://core.telegram.org/api/stars#transferring-stars-from-a-business-account-to-the-business-bot
// @see https://core.telegram.org/bots/faq#how-can-i-message-all-of-my-bot-39s-subscribers-at-once
// @see https://core.telegram.org/constructor/inputMediaInvoice
// @see https://core.telegram.org/constructor/messageMediaGiveaway
