// @description Represents a star gift, see here » for more info.
// @param auction If set, this is a collectible gift that can only be bought through a collectible gift auction » .
// @param auction_slug Always set for gifts that can be bought on auctions » , contains the auction deep link slug » .
// @param auction_start_date Always set for gifts that can be bought on auctions » , contains the UNIX timestamp indicating when will the auction start (or when the auction started, if it points to the past).
// @param availability_remains For limited-supply gifts: the remaining number of gifts that may be bought.
// @param availability_resale The total number of (upgraded to collectibles ) gifts of this type currently on resale
// @param availability_total For limited-supply gifts: the total number of gifts that was available in the initial supply.
// @param background Default background palette for this gift type, used when rendering gift cards and previews before a specific collectible backdrop is chosen.
// @param birthday Whether this is a birthday-themed gift
// @param convert_stars The receiver of this gift may convert it to this many Telegram Stars, instead of displaying it on their profile page. convert_stars will be equal to stars only if the gift was bought using recently bought Telegram Stars, otherwise it will be less than stars .
// @param first_sale_date For sold out gifts only: when was the gift first bought.
// @param flags Flags, see TL conditional fields
// @param gifts_per_round Always set for gifts that can be bought on auctions » , contains the number of gifts of this kind that are distributed on every round.
// @param id Identifier of the gift
// @param last_sale_date For sold out gifts only: when was the gift last bought.
// @param limited Whether this is a limited-supply gift.
// @param limited_per_user If set, the maximum number of gifts of this type that can be owned by a single user is limited and specified in per_user_total , and the remaining slots for the current user in per_user_remains .
// @param locked_until_date If set, the specified gift possibly cannot be sent until the specified date, see here » for the full flow.
// @param peer_color_available If set, collectible gifts of this type may be used to generate a message color palette and pattern » .
// @param per_user_remains Remaining number of gifts of this type that can be owned by the current user.
// @param per_user_total Maximum number of gifts of this type that can be owned by any user.
// @param released_by This gift was released by the specified peer.
// @param require_premium This gift can only be bought by users with a Premium subscription.
// @param resell_min_stars The minimum price in Stars for gifts of this type currently on resale .
// @param sold_out Whether this gift sold out and cannot be bought anymore.
// @param stars Price of the gift in Telegram Stars .
// @param sticker Sticker that represents the gift.
// @param title Title of the gift
// @param upgrade_stars The number of Telegram Stars the user can pay to convert the gift into a collectible gift » .
